もう一つの姿「アムネジア」の差分\n同じ線画を用いた差分で構いません。本当に余裕があればでいいので前述した4つの差分も。\n\n・その他の要項\n┗グッズには使用しません。\n┗SNSのアイコンやヘッダー、動画配信のサムネイルやその中身でPuppet3やだれでもVtuberをかませて使用させていただくことがあります。\n┗今後チャンネルの収益化をする可能性があります。\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、もしよければわたしのリクエストをお描きいただければと思います。\nよろしくおねがいします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 256, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "筆禍＠ぴかすすちゃん発売中", "screen_name": "hikka06", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062499802882232320/REN7JKt9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/85097065/1737786245/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 14, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 161}, {"id": 13775, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "SINOHIRA RIN", "screen_name": "Rin2331", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1955137286036946944/ilfOUU_M.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2955478670/1762949846/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 0}, {"id": 1129627, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "笹身田ぴよ🐥COMITIA156【B08a】", "screen_name": "piyossmd", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1589125888226250752/XdYbJF99.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1127728795/1675070263/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": 